        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5306AST, Aston Lever with Urban Modern Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Aston Lever with Urban Modern Rose is a stunning combination of soft lines and contemporary silhouettes. This transitional leverset is available in an array of beautiful finishes including matte black, satin nickel, and polished chrome. The Aston Lever with Urban Modern Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AST-specifications.gif?v=1704354639\" width=\"600\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Aston Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Brass Aston Door Lever with Arched Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Aston Leverset with Urban Modern Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AST-specifications.pdf?v=1704262369\"><b>Emtek Aston Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5059BA-finish.jpg?v=1704354563\" width=\"514\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Aston Lever with Urban Modern Rose",
                "description": "The Aston Lever with Urban Modern Rose is a stunning combination of soft lines and contemporary silhouettes. This transitional leverset is available in an array of beautiful finishes including matte black, satin nickel, and polished chrome. The Aston Lever with Urban Modern Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Aston Leverset with Urban Modern Roses, Modern Brass Aston Door Lever with Arched Square Roses, Aston Lever with Urban Modern Rosettes, Aston Lever with Urban Modern Roses, Emtek 5306AST dummy levers, Emtek 5316AST passage levers, Emtek 5326AST privacy levers, EMT-5306AST, EMT-5316AST, EMT-5326AST, contemporary levers, modern levers, transitional levers,"
